    "description": "The Business Central client renders non-editable fields that have an OnDrillDown trigger as HTML <a> (anchor) elements. Screen readers correctly announce these as links. OnDrillDown on a non-editable field is therefore not an accessibility issue — the platform handles the semantics.",
